            "answer": {
              "short": "$E(J)=1.55$ baskets; $\\operatorname{Var}(J)=2.0475\\approx2.05$ baskets$^2$.",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}E(J)&=0(0.35)+1(0.2)+2(0.1)\\\\&\\quad+3(0.25)+4(0.1)\\\\&=1.55\\end{aligned}$$\n$$\\begin{aligned}E(J^2)&=0^2(0.35)+1^2(0.2)+2^2(0.1)\\\\&\\quad+3^2(0.25)+4^2(0.1)\\\\&=4.45\\end{aligned}$$\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{Var}(J)&=E(J^2)-[E(J)]^2\\\\&=4.45-1.55^2\\\\&=2.0475\\\\&\\approx2.05\\end{aligned}$$\nThe expected value is $1.55$ baskets and the variance is approximately $2.05$ baskets$^2$.",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
