            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$E(L)=1.4$ baskets; $\\operatorname{Var}(L)=0.84$ baskets$^2$.",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}E(L)&=0(0.2)+1(0.3)+2(0.4)\\\\&\\quad+3(0.1)+4(0)\\\\&=1.4\\end{aligned}$$\n$$\\begin{aligned}E(L^2)&=0^2(0.2)+1^2(0.3)+2^2(0.4)\\\\&\\quad+3^2(0.1)+4^2(0)\\\\&=2.8\\end{aligned}$$\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{Var}(L)&=E(L^2)-[E(L)]^2\\\\&=2.8-1.4^2\\\\&=0.84\\end{aligned}$$\nThe expected value is $1.4$ baskets and the variance is $0.84$ baskets$^2$.",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 53
          }
        ]
