        "answer": {
          "short": "John is expected to score more baskets, assuming they play the same number of games, since $1.55>1.4$.",
          "worked": "John averages $1.55$ baskets per game, compared with Liam’s $1.4$. For the same number of games, John is therefore expected to score more baskets throughout the season.",
